WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.352
Welcome back to Leonardo's workshop in Milan.

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:06.057
Last time, you counted gold.

00:00:06.107 --> 00:00:08.797
Today, something is missing.

00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:11.804
The storeroom floor is 7 feet wide.

00:00:11.854 --> 00:00:15.275
Bernardo counted 56 floor tiles.

00:00:15.325 --> 00:00:23.518
Each tile is a square, 1 foot on every side, and the tiles cover the whole floor with none left over.

00:00:23.568 --> 00:00:29.369
But crates block the far wall, so nobody can measure how long the room is.

00:00:29.419 --> 00:00:31.947
Look at the floor and the tiles.

00:00:31.997 --> 00:00:33.781
What do you notice?

00:00:33.831 --> 00:00:35.720
What do you wonder?

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.044
Write it down.

00:00:37.094 --> 00:00:42.802
Then make a guess: is the floor longer than it is wide, or shorter?

00:00:42.852 --> 00:00:46.160
Hold on to your guess, and find out your own way.
